WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:00.960
Aku mengerti

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.360
(Episode 74)

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.240
Bagus kalau 
mengerti, lakukanlah

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.960
Tuan Linken 
aku mengagumimu 

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.920
Mulai sekarang

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.600
aku akan menjadi muridmu

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.600
Apa yang dimengerti Dokter Yurgi?

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.040
Ada apa ini?

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.880
Ya ampun, 
Dokter Yurgi kelak 

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.320
akan jadi murid Linken

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.160
Aku, pamit dulu 

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.800
Semuanya sudah berakhir

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.600
Tandi 

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.760
Hidup kembali 

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.120
Dokter Yurgi

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.520
Gak benar, Dokter Yurgi

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.600
Dia gak hidup

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:44.600
Dia belum hidup 

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.040
Dia akan segera hidup

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:46.760
Ah?

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:49.720
Ini...

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.360
Masih gak hidup

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.480
Aduh

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:57.720
Benaran hidup!

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.720
Hidup lagi, 
benaran hidup

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.320
Ayah

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.480
Kenapa begini?

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.320
Aku hidup lagi?

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:06.920
Menurutmu?

